nded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>SECTOR_7: SCANNED</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>SYSTEM_NOMINAL: TRUE</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>LATENCY: 12MS</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>PACKET_LOSS: 0.01%</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>ALLOCATING_RESOURCES</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>SECTOR_7: SCANNED</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 pr-8 text-xs font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-neutral-500 tracking-widest uppercase\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                        <span>SYSTEM_NOMINAL: TRUE</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>LATENCY: 12MS</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>PACKET_LOSS: 0.01%</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>ALLOCATING_RESOURCES</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>SECTOR_7: SCANNED</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>SYSTEM_NOMINAL: TRUE</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>LATENCY: 12MS</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>PACKET_LOSS: 0.01%</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>ALLOCATING_RESOURCES</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                        <span>SECTOR_7: SCANNED</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- D3 Point Cloud Globe -->\n                            <div id=\"globe-container\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-[320px] md:max-w-[380px] aspect-square flex items-center justify-center cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing group/globe z-10\">\n                                <!-- Subtle Backdrop Glow -->\n                                <div id=\"globe-glow\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/5 blur-[80px] rounded-full pointer-events-none opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000\"></div>\n\n                                <canvas id=\"globe-canvas\" class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000\"></canvas>\n\n                                <div id=\"globe-loading\" class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-20 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-500\">\n                                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] animate-pulse\">Initializing...</span>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div id=\"globe-label\" class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 text-center z-20 pointer-events-none opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000\">\n                                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-widest\">Interactive Projection</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Coordinate Readouts -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-12 left-6 flex flex-col gap-1.5 z-10 pointer-events-none hidden sm:flex\">\n                                <div class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-neutral-500 tracking-widest\">AZIMUTH: <span id=\"ui-x\" class=\"text-neutral-300\">000</span></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 right-6 flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5 text-right z-10 pointer-events-none hidden sm:flex\">\n                                <div class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-neutral-500 tracking-widest\">ELEVATION: <span id=\"ui-y\" class=\"text-neutral-300\">000</span></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Bottom Marquee -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-8 border-t border-white/[0.03] bg-neutral-950/80 backdrop-blur flex items-center overflow-hidden z-20 pointer-events-none\">\n                                <div id=\"marquee-bottom\" class=\"flex w-max\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 pr-8 text-xs font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-neutral-600 tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                                        <span>IDLE_STATE</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></span>\n                                        <span>WAITING_FOR_INPUT</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></span>\n                                        <span>SENSORS: ONLINE</span><span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></span>\n                                        <span>CONNECTION